aquila-radio-astronomy (0.2.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Snap: the receiver scan works inside the sandbox (sysfs is closed to it), so a
    HydraSDR is no longer taken for an Airspy and started at a rate it lacks.
  * Settings: bias tee switch (Quick setup pointed at it, it was missing).
  * Snap: opens on X11 desktops (Qt's xcb libraries were not shipped); the
    one-time USB permission dialog shows the command as a code box with a
    Copy button and offers the .deb instead.
  * README screenshots from the Windows build with a calibrated 2.4 m dish.

